## Scenarios

### Chromium Event Bridge — stateless translation

#### maps escape to NormalMode

- Verify: maps escape to NormalMode


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 8 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: maps escape to NormalMode")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val ev = translate_key_event(27, 0)
match ev:
    UIEvent.NormalMode =>
        expect(true).to_be_true()
    _ =>
        expect(false).to_be_true()
```

</details>

